Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day: a month flipped. By
4 October the desk had **412 reports**.

**Merged as one issue, but two causes are visible.** The shared parser reads dates month first. Booking-v3 also displays a month-first hint while its form reads the tenant's order. See the [signed review](/kb/incidents/4471-review) for separate tickets, counts, and unresolved timing symptoms. This export does not establish that either fix has shipped.

<Callout>
The known label does not prove a single cause. Read the computed table and the report details together.
</Callout>

